  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Sugars Helpbook Heat Content / Centrifugal Heat Loss
  // Source basis: Theory > Heat Content and Theory > Centrifugal Calculations.
  // The Helpbook publishes the syrup/crystal Cp equations; heat content is obtained
